 viewBox="0 0 11 11" width="11" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="absolute top-0 right-0"><path d="M11 1L11 11L10 11L10 7C10 3.68629 7.31371 1 4 1L-4.37114e-08 1L0 -4.80825e-07L11 4.37114e-07L11 1Z" fill="var(--border-faint)"></path></svg><svg fill="none" height="11" viewBox="0 0 11 11" width="11" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="rotate-180 absolute bottom-0 left-0"><path d="M11 1L11 11L10 11L10 7C10 3.68629 7.31371 1 4 1L-4.37114e-08 1L0 -4.80825e-07L11 4.37114e-07L11 1Z" fill="var(--border-faint)"></path></svg></div></div></div><div class="lg:hidden"><!--$!--><template data-dgst="BAILOUT_TO_CLIENT_SIDE_RENDERING"></template><!--/$--></div><div class="relative max-w-[910px] mx-auto px-16"><div class="p-4 rounded-full flex w-max mx-auto mb-20 lg:mb-16 items-center relative before:inside-border before:border-border-faint mt-4 lg:mt-0"><div class="px-10 py-1 text-label-small">Alternatives</div></div><h1 class="text-[30px] leading-[34px] tracking-[-0.4px] font-medium lg:text-title-h2 mx-auto text-center mb-16 lg:mb-24 break-words px-24 lg:px-0 mt-10 lg:mt-0"><span class="text-heat-100">Firecrawl</span> Alternatives</h1><p class="text-center text-body-large mb-24 lg:mb-32 max-w-[700px] mx-auto break-words px-32 lg:px-0">In-depth, evidence-based comparisons to help you pick the best solution.</p><div class="flex flex-row gap-16 justify-center items-center mx-auto w-max"><a class="block w-max" href="/app/playground"><button type="button" data-state="idle" class="flex items-center justify-center button relative [&amp;&gt;*]:relative text-label-medium lg-max:[&amp;_svg]:size-24 button-primary group/button focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-heat-100 disabled:cursor-not-allowed rounded-10 px-12 py-8 gap-6 text-accent-white hover:bg-[color:var(--heat-90)] active:[scale:0.995] disabled:opacity-80 disabled:[&amp;_.button-background]:opacity-70"><div class="overlay button-background !absolute"></div>Try Firecrawl</button></a><a class="block w-max" href="#comparisons"><button type="button" data-state="idle" class="flex items-center justify-center button relative [&amp;&gt;*]:relative text-label-medium lg-max:[&amp;_svg]:size-24 button-secondary group/button focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-border-muted disabled:cursor-not-allowed rounded-10 px-12 py-8 gap-6 text-accent-black active:[scale:0.99] active:bg-black-alpha-7 bg-black-alpha-4 hover:bg-black-alpha-6 disabled:bg-black-alpha-3 disabled:text-black-alpha-48 disabled:hover:bg-black-alpha-3">See comparisons</button></a></div></div></div><div class="container lg:contents !p-16 relative -mt-90"><div class="absolute top-0 left-[calc(50%-50vw)] w-screen h-1 bg-border-faint lg:hidden"></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 left-[calc(50%-50vw)] w-screen h-1 bg-border-faint lg:hidden"></div><svg fill="none" height="21" viewBox="0 0 22 21" width="22" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="pointer-events-none contain-[layout,paint] absolute absolute -top-10 -left-[10.5px] lg:hidden"><path d="M10.5 4C10.5 7.31371 7.81371 10 4.5 10H0.5V11H4.5C7.81371 11 10.5 13.6863 10.5 17V21H11.5V17C11.5 13.6863 14.1863 11 17.5 11H21.5V10H17.5C14.1863 10 11.5 7.31371 11.5 4V0H10.5V4Z" fill="var(--border-faint)"></path></svg><svg fill="none" height="21" viewBox="0 0 22 21" width="22" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="pointer-events-none contain-[layout,paint] absolute absolute -top-10 -right-[10.5px] lg:hidden"><path d="M10.5 4C10.5 7.31371 7.81371 10 4.5 10H0.5V11H4.5C7.81371 11 10.5 13.6863 10.5 17V21H11.5V17C11.5 13.6863 14.1863 11 17.5 11H21.5V10H17.5C14.1863 10 11.5 7.31371 11.5 4V0H10.5V4Z" fill="var(--border-faint)"></path></svg><svg fill="none" height="21" viewBox="0 0 22 21" width="22" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="pointer-events-none contain-[layout,paint] absolute absolute -bottom-10 -left-[10.5px] lg:hidden"><path d="M10.5 4C10.5 7.31371 7.81371 10 4.5 10H0.5V11H4.5C7.81371 11 10.5 13.6863 10.5 17V21H11.5V17C11.5 13.6863 14.1863 11 17.5 11H21.5V10H17.5C14.1863 10 11.5 7.31371 11.5 4V0H10.5V4Z" fill="var(--border-faint)"></path></svg><svg fill="none" height="21" viewBox="0 0 22 21" width="22" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="pointer-events-none contain-[layout,paint] absolute absolute -bottom-10 -right-[10.5px] lg:hidden"><path d="M10.5 4C10.5 7.31371 7.81371 10 4.5 10H0.5V11H4.5C7.81371 11 10.5 13.6863 10.5 17V21H11.5V17C11.5 13.6863 14.1863 11 17.5 11H21.5V10H17.5C14.1863 10 11.5 7.31371 11.5 4V0H10.5V4Z" fill="var(--border-faint)"></path></svg></div></section><section class="container -mt-1" id="measured-performance"><div class="relative py-48 lg:py-64"><div class="h-1 bg-border-faint top-0 left-0 w-full absolute"></div><div class="px-20 lg:px-64"><h2 class="text-title-h4 font-semibold mb-16">Measured performance</h2><p class="text-body-large text-black-alpha-64 mb-32 max-w-[720px]">Published Firecrawl results, each with the dataset it was measured on and the date it was run. Follow a row to the run it comes from.</p><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table class="w-full border-collapse"><caption class="sr-only">Published Firecrawl benchmark results with dataset and measurement date</caption><thead><tr class="border-b border-border-faint"><th scope="col" class="text-left py-16 px-20 text-label-medium text-black-alpha-72 font-normal">Metric</th><th scope="col" class="text-left py-16 px-20 text-label-medium text-heat-100 font-semibold">Value</th><th scope="col" class="text-left py-16 px-20 text-label-medium text-black-alpha-72 font-normal">Dataset</th><th scope="col" class="text-left py-16 px-20 text-label-medium text-black-alpha-72 font-normal">Measured</th><th scope="col" class="text-left py-16 px-20 text-label-medium text-black-alpha-72 font-normal">Source</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="border-b border-border-faint last:border-b-0"><th scope="row" class="py-16 px-20 text-body-medium text-black-alpha-88 font-normal text-left">Coverage (success rate)</th><td class="py-16 px-20 text-body-medium text-black-alpha-88 tabular-nums">96%</td><td class="py-16 px-20 text-body-medium text-black-alpha-72">Scrape coverage and quality, 1,000 URLs</td><td class="py-16 px-20 text-body-medium text-black-alpha-72">Jan 13, 2026</td><td class="py-16 px-20 text-body-medium"><a class="text-heat-100 hover:underline" href="/benchmarks#scrape-content">Methodology</a></td></tr><tr class="border-b border-border-faint last:border-b-0"><th scope="row" class="py-16 px-20 text-body-medium text-black-alpha-88 font-normal text-left">Extraction accuracy (F1)</th><td class="py-16 px-20 text-body-medium text-black-alpha-88 tabular-nums">0.638</td><td class="py-16 px-20 text-body-medium text-black-alpha-72">Scrape coverage and quality, 1,000 URLs</td><td class="py-16 px-20 text-body-medium text-black-alpha-72">Jan 13, 2026</td><td class="py-16 px-20 text-body-medium"><a class="text-heat-100 hover:underline" href="/benchmarks#scrape-content">Methodology</a></td></tr><tr class="border-b border-border-faint last:border-b-0"><th scope="row" class="py-16 px-20 text-body-medium text-black-alpha-88 font-normal text-left">Content recall</th><td class="py-16 px-20 text-body-medium text-black-alpha-88 tabular-nums">0.639</td><td class="py-16 px-20 text-body-medium text-black-alpha-72">Scrape coverage and quality, 1,000 URLs</td><td class="py-16 px-20 text-body-medium text-black-alpha-72">Jan 13, 2026</td><td class="py-16 px-20 text-body-medium"><a class="text-heat-100 hover:underline" href="/benchmarks#scrape-content">Methodology</a></td></tr><tr class="border-b border-border-faint last:border-b-0"><th scope="row" class="py-16 px-20 text-body-medium text-black-alpha-88 font-normal text-left">Latency (P95)</th><td class="py-16 px-20 text-body-medium text-black-alpha-88 tabular-nums">3,387 ms</td><td class="py-16 px-20 text-body-medium text-black-alpha-72">Scrape coverage and quality, 1,000 URLs</td><td class="py-16 px-20 text-body-medium text-black-alpha-72">Jan 13, 2026</td><td class="py-16 px-20 text-body-medium"><a class="text-heat-100 hover:underline" href="/benchmarks#scrape-content">Methodology</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="relative mt-32"><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none contain-[layout,paint] curvy-rect"><svg fill="none" height="11" viewBox="0 0 11 11" width="11" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="-rotate-90 absolute top-0 left-0"><path d="M11 1L11 11L10 11L10 7C10 3.68629 7.31371 1 4 1L-4.37114e-08 1L0 -4.80825e-07L11 4.37114e-07L11 1Z" fill="var(--border-faint)"></path></svg><svg fill="none" height="11" viewBox="0 0 11 11" width="11" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="absolute top-0 right-0"><path d="M11 1L11 11L10 11L10 7C10 3.68629 7.31371 1 4 1L-4.37114e-08 1L0 -4.80825e-07L11 4.37114e-07L11 1Z" fill="var(--border-faint)"></path></svg><svg fill="none" height="11" viewBox="0 0 11 11" width="11" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="rotate-180 absolute bottom-0 left-0"><path d="M11 1L11 11L10 11L10 7C10 3.68629 7.31371 1 4 1L-4.37114e-08 1L0 -4.80825e-07L11 4.37114e-07L11 1Z" fill="var(--border-faint)"></path></svg><svg fill="none" height="11" viewBox="0 0 11 11" width="11" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="rotate-90 absolute bottom-0 right-0"><path d="M11 1L11 11L10 11L10 7C10 3.68629 7.31371 1 4 1L-4.37114e-08 1L0 -4.80825e-07L11 4.37114e-07L11 1Z" fill="var(--border-faint)"></path></svg></div><div class="relative z-10 p-24 text-body-base text-black-alpha-72"><p class="mb-8 last:mb-0">Scrape coverage and quality scored against the public dataset firecrawl/scrape-content-dataset-v1, so the inputs are checkable. The harness is not published yet, so the run cannot be reproduced end to end.</p><p class="mt-16">Every benchmark Firecrawl runs is listed on<!-- --> <a class="text-heat-100 hover:underline" href="/benchmarks">/benchmarks</a>.</p></div></div></div></div></section><div class="container -mt-1"><div class="lg:grid lg:grid-cols-3 relative -mt-1" id="comparisons"><div class="w-full h-10 -bottom-1 absolute pointer-events-none contain-[layout,paint] curvy-rect"><svg fill="none" height="11" viewBox="0 0 11 11" width="11" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="rotate-180 absolute bottom-0 left-0"><path d="M11 1L11 11L10 11L10 7C10 3.68629 7.31371 1 4 1L-4.37114e-08 1L0 -4.80825e-07L11 4.37114e-07L11 1Z" fill="var(--border-faint)"></path></svg><svg fill="none" height="11" viewBox="0 0 11 11" width="11" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="rotate-90 absolute bottom-0 right-0"><path d="M11 1L11 11L10 11L10 7C10 3.68629 7.31371 1 4 1L-4.37114e-08 1L0 -4.80825e-07L11 4.37114e-07L11 1Z" fill="var(--border-faint)"></path></svg></div><div class="w-1 absolute top-0 h-full bg-border-faint hidden lg:block" style="left:0%"></div><div class="w-1 absolute top-0 h-full bg-border-faint hidden lg:block" style="left:33.333333333333336%"></div><div class="w-1 absolute top-0 h-full bg-border-faint hidden lg:block" style="left:66.66666666666667%"></div><a class="block hover:bg-black-alpha-2 transition-all border-t border-border-faint" href="/alternatives/firecrawl-vs-apify"><div class="flex flex-col h-full"><div class="p-24 lg:p-44 flex-1"><div class="text-label-x-large mb-16 lg:mb-24 text-accent-black">Firecrawl vs. Apify</div><div class="text-body-large text-black-alpha-64 line-clamp-3">Compare Firecrawl&#x27;s API-first simplicity with Apify&#x27;s Actor marketplace for web scraping and data extraction.</div></div></div></a><a class="block hover:bg-black-alpha-2 transition-all border-t border-border-faint" href="/alternatives/firecrawl-vs-bright-data"><div class="flex flex-col h-full"><div class="p-24 lg:p-44 flex-1"><div class="text-label-x-large mb-16 lg:mb-24 text-accent-black">Firecrawl vs Bright Data</div><div class="text-body-large text-black-alpha-64 line-clamp-3">Compare Firecrawl and Bright Data across data quality, pricing, and speed. See why developers choose Firecrawl to power their AI agents and apps.</div></div></div></a><a class="block hover:bg-black-alpha-2 transition-all border-t border-border-faint" href="/alternatives/firecrawl-vs-scrapingbee"><div class="flex flex-col h-full"><div class="p-24 lg:p-44 flex-1"><div class="text-label-x-large mb-16 lg:mb-24 text-accent-black">Firecrawl vs ScrapingBee</div><div class="text-body-large text-black-alpha-64 line-clamp-3">Compare Firecrawl and ScrapingBee for LLM-ready output, multi-page crawling, and unified API. See why developers choose Firecrawl.</div></div></div></a><a class="block hover:bg-black-alpha-2 transition-all border-t border-border-faint" href="/alternatives/firecrawl-vs-steel"><div class="flex flex-col h-full"><div class="p-24 lg:p-44 flex-1"><div class="text-label-x-large mb-16 lg:mb-24 text-accent-black">Firecrawl vs Steel</div><div class="text-body-large text-black-alpha-64 line-clamp-3">Compare Firecrawl and Steel for web scraping, crawling, and data extraction. See why developers choose Firecrawl to power their AI agents and apps.</div></div></div></a><a class="block hover:bg-black-alpha-2 transition-all border-t border-border-faint" href="/alternatives/firecrawl-vs-browser-use"><div class="flex flex-col h-full"><div class="p-24 lg:p-44 flex-1"><div class="text-label-x-large mb-16 lg:mb-24 text-accent-black">Firecrawl vs Browser Use</div><div class="text-body-large text-black-alpha-64 line-clamp-3">Compare Firecrawl and Browser Use for web scraping, crawling, and data extraction. See why developers choose Firecrawl to power their AI agents and apps.</div></div></div></a><a class="block hover:bg-black-alpha-2 transition-all border-t border-border-faint" href="/alternatives/firecrawl-vs-brave-search-api"><div class="flex flex-col h-full"><div class="p-24 lg:p-44 flex-1"><div class="text-label-x-large mb-16 lg:mb-24 text-accent-black">Firecrawl vs Brave Search API</div><div class="text-body-large text-black-alpha-64 line-clamp-3">Compare Firecrawl and Brave Search API on extraction, pricing, and open source. See why developers choose Firecrawl to power their AI agents and apps.</div></div></div></a><a class="block hover:bg-black-alpha-2 transition-all border-t border-border-faint" href="/alternatives/firecrawl-vs-hyperbrowser"><div class="flex flex-col h-full"><div class="p-24 lg:p-44 flex-1"><div class="text-label-x-large mb-16 lg:mb-24 text-accent-black">Firecrawl vs Hyperbrowser</div><div class="text-body-large text-black-alpha-64 line-clamp-3">Compare Firecrawl and Hyperbrowser across data quality, pricing, and developer experience. See why developers choose Firecrawl to power their AI agents and apps.</div></div></div></a><a class="block hover:bg-black-alpha-2 transition-all border-t border-border-faint" href="/alternatives/firecrawl-vs-parallel"><div class="flex flex-col h-full"><div class="p-24 lg:p-44 flex-1"><div class="text-label-x-large mb-16 lg:mb-24 text-accent-black">Firecrawl vs Parallel</div><div class="text-body-large text-black-alpha-64 line-clamp-3">Compare Firecrawl and Parallel for clean data extraction, unified API design, and open-source flexibility. See why developers choose Firecrawl to power their AI agents and apps.</div></div></div></a><a class="block hover:bg-black-alpha-2 transition-all border-t border-border-faint" href="/alternatives/firecrawl-vs-tavily"><div class="flex flex-col h-full"><div class="p-24 lg:p-44 flex-1"><div class="text-label-x-large mb-16 lg:mb-24 text-accent-black">Firecrawl vs Tavily</div><div class="text-body-large text-black-alpha-64 line-clamp-3">Compare Firecrawl and Tavily on full-page extraction, token efficiency, and data providers. See why developers choose Firecrawl to power their AI agents and apps.</div></div></div></a><a class="block hover:bg-black-alpha-2 transition-all border-t border-border-faint" href="/alternatives/firecrawl-vs-exa"><div class="flex flex-col h-full"><div class="p-24 lg:p-44 flex-1"><div class="text-label-x-large mb-16 lg:mb-24 text-accent-black">Firecrawl vs Exa</div><div class="text-body-large text-black-alpha-64 line-clamp-3">Compare Firecrawl and Exa on full-page extraction, token efficiency, and data providers. See why developers choose Firecrawl to power their AI agents and apps.</div></div></div></a><a class="block hover:bg-black-alpha-2 transition-all border-t border-border-faint" href="/alternatives/firecrawl-vs-scrapfly"><div class="flex flex-col h-full"><div class="p-24 lg:p-44 flex-1"><div class="text-label-x-large mb-16 lg:mb-24 text-accent-black">Firecrawl vs Scrapfly</div><div class="text-body-large text-black-alpha-64 line-clamp-3">Compare Firecrawl and Scrapfly for AI-ready data extraction, pricing, and developer experience. See why developers choose Firecrawl to power their AI pipelines.</div></div></div></a><a class="block hover:bg-black-alpha-2 transition-all border-t border-border-faint" href="/alternatives/firecrawl-vs-jina-ai"><div class="flex flex-col h-full"><div class="p-24 lg:p-44 flex-1"><div class="text-label-x-large mb-16 lg:mb-24 text-accent-black">Firecrawl vs Jina AI</div><div class="text-body-large text-black-alpha-64 line-clamp-3">Compare Firecrawl and Jina AI for web scraping, search, and browser automation. See why 1.25M+ developers choose Firecrawl to power their AI agents and apps.</div></div></div></a><a class="block hover:bg-black-alpha-2 transition-all border-t border-border-faint" href="/alternatives/firecrawl-vs-zyte"><div class="flex flex-col h-full"><div class="p-24 lg:p-44 flex-1"><div class="text-label-x-large mb-16 lg:mb-24 text-accent-black">Firecrawl vs Zyte</div><div class="text-body-large text-black-alpha-64 line-clamp-3">Compare Firecrawl and Zyte for data quality, pricing simplicity, and AI-ready output. See why 1.25M+ developers choose Firecrawl to power their AI agents and apps.</div></div></div></a><a class="block hover:bg-black-alpha-2 transition-all border-t border-border-faint" href="/alternatives/firecrawl-vs-browserbase"><div class="flex flex-col h-full"><div class="p-24 lg:p-44 flex-1"><div class="text-label-x-large mb-16 lg:mb-24 text-accent-black">Firecrawl vs Browserbase</div><div class="text-body-large text-black-alpha-64 line-clamp-3">Compare Firecrawl and Browserbase for web scraping and data extraction. See why developers choose Firecrawl for AI-ready data without managing browser sessions.</div></div></div></a><a class="block hover:bg-black-alpha-2 transition-all border-t border-border-faint" href="/alternatives/firecrawl-vs-crawl4ai"><div class="flex flex-col h-full"><div class="p-24 lg:p-44 flex-1"><div class="text-label-x-large mb-16 lg:mb-24 text-accent-black">Firecrawl vs Crawl4AI</div><div class="text-body-large text-black-alpha-64 line-clamp-3">Compare Firecrawl and Crawl4AI for AI web scraping. See why 1.25M+ developers choose Firecrawl&#x27;s managed API over self-hosting a Python crawler library.</div></div></div></a><a class="block hover:bg-black-alpha-2 transition-all border-t border-border-faint" href="/alternatives/firecrawl-vs-scrape-do"><div class="flex flex-col h-full"><div class="p-24 lg:p-44 flex-1"><div class="text-label-x-large mb-16 lg:mb-24 text-accent-black">Firecrawl vs Scrape.do</div><div class="text-body-large text-black-alpha-64 line-clamp-3">Compare Firecrawl and Scrape.do across data quality, AI readiness, and developer experience. See why 1.25M+ developers choose Firecrawl over basic scraping proxies.</div></div></div></a><a class="block hover:bg-black-alpha-2 transition-all border-t border-border-faint" href="/alternatives/firecrawl-vs-scrapegraphai"><div class="flex flex-col h-full"><div class="p-24 lg:p-44 flex-1"><div class="text-label-x-large mb-16 lg:mb-24 text-accent-black">Firecrawl vs ScrapeGraphAI</div><div class="text-body-large text-black-alpha-64 line-clamp-3">Compare Firecrawl and ScrapeGraphAI across pricing, capabilities, and scale. See why 1.25M+ developers choose Firecrawl for AI-powered web scraping.</div></div></div></a><a class="block hover:bg-black-alpha-2 transition-all border-t border-border-faint" href="/alternatives/firecrawl-vs-scraperapi"><div class="flex flex-col h-full"><div class="p-24 lg:p-44 flex-1"><div class="text-label-x-large mb-16 lg:mb-24 text-accent-black">Firecrawl vs ScraperAPI</div><div class="text-body-large text-black-alpha-64 line-clamp-3">Compare Firecrawl and ScraperAPI for output quality, pricing predictability, and API simplicity. See why 1.25M+ developers choose Firecrawl to power their AI agents and apps.</div></div></div></a><a class="block hover:bg-black-alpha-2 transition-all border-t border-border-faint" href="/alternatives/firecrawl-vs-context-dev"><div class="flex flex-col h-full"><div class="p-24 lg:p-44 flex-1"><div class="text-label-x-large mb-16 lg:mb-24 text-accent-black">Firecrawl vs Context.dev</div><div class="text-body-large text-black-alpha-64 line-clamp-3">Compare Firecrawl and Context.dev across web scraping depth, open-source flexibility, and browser interaction. See why 1.25M+ developers choose Firecrawl to power their AI agents and apps.</div></div></div></a><a class="block hover:bg-black-alpha-2 transition-all border-t border-border-faint" href="/alternatives/firecrawl-vs-tinyfish"><div class="flex flex-col h-full"><div class="p-24 lg:p-44 flex-1"><div class="text-label-x-large mb-16 lg:mb-24 text-accent-black">Firecrawl vs TinyFish</div><div class="text-body-large text-black-alpha-64 line-clamp-3">Compare Firecrawl and TinyFish on crawl and batch scale, an open source AGPL-3.0 platform, nine SDKs and native MCP support, and retries that keep blocked pages in the corpus. See why 1.25M+ developers choose Firecrawl to power their AI agents and apps.</div></div></div></a><a class="block hover:bg-black-alpha-2 transition-all border-t border-border-faint" href="/alternatives/firecrawl-vs-context7"><div class="flex flex-col h-full"><div class="p-24 lg:p-44 flex-1"><div class="text-label-x-large mb-16 lg:mb-24 text-accent-black">Firecrawl vs Context7</div><div class="text-body-large text-black-alpha-64 line-clamp-3">Compare Firecrawl and Context7 on developer retrieval. Firecrawl Developer Index leads the open DevDex benchmark at 63.1% Recall@10 vs Context7&#x27;s 16.8%, covering docs, READMEs, issues, and merged PRs.</div></div></div></a></div></div><div class="h-92 lg:h-160 -mt-1 relative container z-[2]"><div class="overlay pointer-events-none contain-[layout,paint] curvy-rect"><svg fill="none" height="11" viewBox="0 0 11 11" width="11" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="-rotate-90 absolute top-0 left-0"><path d="M11 1L11 11L10 11L10 7C10 3.68629 7.31371 1 4 1L-4.37114e-08 1L0 -4.80825e-07L11 4.37114e-07L11 1Z" fill="var(--border-faint)"></path></svg><svg fill="none" height="11" viewBox="0 0 11 11" width="11" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="absolute top-0 right-0"><path d="M11 1L11 11L10 11L10 7C10 3.68629 7.31371 1 4 1L-4.37114e-08 1L0 -4.80825e-07L11 4.37114e-07L11 1Z" fill="var(--border-faint)"></path></svg><svg fill="none" height="11" viewBox="0 0 11 11" width="11" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="rotate-180 absolute bottom-0 left-0"><path d="M11 1L11 11L10 11L10 7C10 3.68629 7.31371 1 4 1L-4.37114e-08 1L0 -4.80825e-07L11 4.37114e-07L11 1Z" fill="var(--border-faint)"></path></svg><svg fill="none" height="11" viewBox="0 0 11 11" width="11" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="rotate-90 absolute bottom-0 right-0"><path d="M11 1L11 11L10 11L10 7C10 3.68629 7.31371 1 4 1L-4.37114e-08 1L0 -4.80825e-07L11 4.37114e-07L11 1Z" fill="var(--border-faint)"></path></svg></div><div class="h-1 top-0 absolute w-screen left-[calc(50%-50vw)] bg-border-faint"></div><div class="h-1 bottom-0 absolute w-screen left-[calc(50%-50vw)] bg-border-faint"></div><svg fill="none" height="21" viewBox="0 0 22 21" width="22" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="pointer-events-none contain-[layout,paint] absolute absolute -top-[10px] -left-[10.5px]"><path d="M10.5 4C10.5 7.31371 7